    "body": "fix on issue/1594-tormach-end-g53 · PR #1600 · pinned by tormach_program_end (every_tormach_mill_program_ends_z_up_then_m30_with_no_g30, a_stated_safe_z_ends_at_that_z_with_no_g30, a_fourth_axis_program_ends_without_returning_a) · merges when reviewed. The program ends M5, G53 G0 Z0, M30 (the user's Hub choice C). The tool-change G30 is unchanged. 33 Tormach mill goldens lose only their final G30 line. Follow-up for the remaining bare G30s (tool change, plasma, lathe): #1596.",
